OL,3,GNEWSATree surgeon stuck upside down in
OL,4,Atree rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tree surgeon was rescued by fire
OL,7,Fcrews after getting stuck upside down
OL,8,Fwhile working on a tree in
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Leicestershire Fire
OL,12,Fand Rescue Service said firefighters
OL,13,Fwere called to Byron Street Extension
OL,14,Fin Loughborough at 15:57 BST on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
