OL,3,GNEWSATree surgeon stuck upside down in
OL,4,Atree rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews from Loughborough, Hinckley,
OL,7,FShepshed and Central fire stations
OL,8,Fattended. The service said initial
OL,9,Fcrews put ladders up and held the tree
OL,10,Fsurgeon in place, while they awaited
OL,11,Fthe arrival of the service's technical
OL,12,Frescue team.
OL,14,FFrom there, the surgeon was attached
OL,15,Fwith a rescue strop, before a "rope
OL,16,Fsystem" was created to secure him and
OL,17,Flower him to the ground, before he was
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital.
